  "prefLabel": "Bea 502.08 Certificate of occupancy",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 502.08 “Certificate of occupancy” means a document issued by a local municipality or the state, upon the satisfactory completion of required inspections, granting permission to occupy the building for its intended use.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
